ok - a parked human-owed gate wakes once per run, step and findings checksum, past a paused: line

RUN test_parked_gate_wake_keeps_a_durable_row_when_delivery_is_lost
ok - a parked-gate wake remains queued when delivery is not acknowledged

RUN test_parked_gate_wake_without_a_status_log_still_wakes
ok - a parked human-owed gate on a ship with no status log still wakes

RUN test_parked_human_gate_with_a_decision_record_does_not_wake
ok - a parked gate with a decision record for its run stays quiet, while another run's record does not

RUN test_parked_gate_wake_skips_running_crewmate_owed_and_scout
